1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,690
A peaceful forest ashram bathed in golden morning light
with a vast banyan tree spreading its branches.

2
00:00:06,690 --> 00:00:13,939
Sunlight filters through leaves creating dancing rays while
birds flutter and chalk mandalas decorate the ground.

3
00:00:13,939 --> 00:00:19,670
An elderly guru sits in calm meditation on a wooden
platform beneath the sacred tree.

4
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:26,309
Students gather around on woven mats with palm-leaf
manuscripts and handmade notebooks ready to learn.

5
00:00:26,309 --> 00:00:33,159
The wise guru raises his hand and begins explaining the
eternal concept of dharma with gentle gestures.

6
00:00:33,159 --> 00:00:39,320
He draws ancient symbols in the sand with a wooden stick as
students watch with growing understanding.

7
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:45,840
Students nod and smile softly as wisdom dawns while a
squirrel scurries past sacred scriptures.

8
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:52,359
The camera pans upward catching sunlight flaring through
banyan leaves ending with peace and revelation.
